      "explanation": "Because \\(2+3=5\\) and \\(2\\cdot3=6\\), the equation factors as\n\\[\n(x-2)(x-3)=0.\n\\]\nA product is zero exactly when at least one factor is zero, so \\(x-2=0\\) or \\(x-3=0\\). The two roots are 2 and 3, and the larger one is 3.",
